{"title":"Career Roadmap · Business Analyst","role":"Business Analyst","summary":"A Business Analyst (BA) identifies business problems, gathers requirements, analyses data and processes, and translates business needs into actionable solutions. The role commonly connects business teams, technology teams, operations, product teams and management.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Business Analyst (BA) identifies business problems, gathers requirements, analyses data and processes, and translates business needs into actionable solutions. The role commonly connects business teams, technology teams, operations, product teams and management."},{"type":"p","text":"An Integrated Programme in Management (IPM – BBA+MBA) is a strong pathway because it combines undergraduate business fundamentals with advanced management education. However, the degree alone does not make someone job-ready as a Business Analyst. The student should deliberately build data analysis, requirements analysis, process modelling, SQL, BI tools and technology awareness."},{"type":"p","text":"A strong progression is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business fundamentals","Data analysis","Requirements","Process analysis","Business systems","Product/technology collaboration","Business transformation"]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build business, analytical, communication and technology foundations"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Work as Business Analyst / Junior Business Analyst / Business Systems Analyst"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Progress toward Senior Business Analyst, Product Analyst or Business Consultant"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Move toward Lead BA, Product Manager, Business Transformation Manager, Consulting Manager or Strategy leadership"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During IPM","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An IPM is generally a 5-year integrated BBA+MBA programme, so the roadmap should deliberately use the early years for fundamentals and the later years for advanced analytics, consulting and management."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Business & Quantitative Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Principles of management"},{"text":"Microeconomics"},{"text":"Macroeconomics"},{"text":"Financial accounting"},{"text":"Business communication"},{"text":"Business mathematics"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Organizational behaviour"},{"text":"Introduction to information systems"},{"text":"Basic Excel"},{"text":"Presentation skills"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Core Question to Learn"},{"type":"p","text":"A Business Analyst should be able to understand:"},{"type":"p","text":"What is the business trying to achieve, what problem is preventing it, and what evidence supports the proposed solution?"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Analytics & Business Processes"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong analytical foundations."},{"type":"h","text":"Data Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Pivot tables"},{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Data visualisation"},{"text":"Power BI"}]},{"type":"h","text":"SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SELECT"},{"text":"WHERE"},{"text":"GROUP BY"},{"text":"ORDER BY"},{"text":"JOINs"},{"text":"CASE"},{"text":"Subqueries"},{"text":"CTEs"},{"text":"Window functions"},{"text":"Aggregations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business Process Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Process mapping"},{"text":"Process flowcharts"},{"text":"SIPOC"},{"text":"As-Is process"},{"text":"To-Be process"},{"text":"Gap analysis"},{"text":"Root-cause analysis"},{"text":"Process improvement"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Core Business Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"This is where the student should begin developing actual Business Analyst capability."},{"type":"h","text":"Requirements Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Stakeholder identification"},{"text":"Requirement gathering"},{"text":"Interviews"},{"text":"Workshops"},{"text":"Requirement documentation"},{"text":"Functional requirements"},{"text":"Non-functional requirements"},{"text":"Business requirements"},{"text":"User requirements"},{"text":"Acceptance criteria"},{"text":"Requirement prioritisation"},{"text":"Requirements Traceability Matrix"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Documentation"},{"type":"p","text":"Practise creating:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business Requirement Document (BRD)"},{"text":"Functional Requirement Document (FRD)"},{"text":"User stories"},{"text":"Use cases"},{"text":"Process maps"},{"text":"Requirement matrices"},{"text":"Product requirement documents"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Agile"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Agile methodology"},{"text":"Scrum"},{"text":"Product backlog"},{"text":"Sprint planning"},{"text":"Daily stand-ups"},{"text":"Sprint review"},{"text":"Retrospectives"},{"text":"User stories"},{"text":"Acceptance criteria"},{"text":"Definition of Done"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Technology & Advanced Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"The student should become comfortable working with technology teams."},{"type":"h","text":"Technology Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SDLC"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"Databases"},{"text":"Cloud fundamentals"},{"text":"Web applications"},{"text":"Authentication basics"},{"text":"System integrations"},{"text":"Data pipelines"},{"text":"Enterprise applications"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The student does not need to become a full-stack developer, but should understand how software systems work."},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced SQL"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Data modelling"},{"text":"DAX"},{"text":"Statistical analysis"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Business metrics"},{"text":"Cohort analysis"},{"text":"Customer segmentation"},{"text":"A/B testing fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Useful Tools"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Jira"},{"text":"Confluence"},{"text":"Miro"},{"text":"Lucidchart / equivalent process-mapping tools"},{"text":"Tableau"},{"text":"Python"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 5 — MBA-Level Strategy & Industry Specialisation"},{"type":"flow","items":["The final stage should combine business analysis","management","industry knowledge."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business strategy"},{"text":"Corporate finance"},{"text":"Operations"},{"text":"Marketing analytics"},{"text":"Product management"},{"text":"Digital transformation"},{"text":"Consulting"},{"text":"Business process optimisation"},{"text":"Strategic decision-making"},{"text":"Change management"},{"text":"Project management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Choose an Industry"},{"type":"p","text":"A Business Analyst can specialise in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Banking & financial services"},{"text":"Healthcare"},{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"Retail"},{"text":"IT/software"},{"text":"Telecom"},{"text":"Manufacturing"},{"text":"Logistics"},{"text":"Insurance"},{"text":"Consulting"},{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"EdTech"},{"text":"SaaS"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Industry knowledge can become a major differentiator."},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year / Capstone Projects"},{"type":"p","text":"The student should graduate with 3–5 substantial business-analysis projects."},{"type":"h","text":"1. Sales Performance Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Customer segments"},{"text":"Product performance"},{"text":"Regional performance"},{"text":"Sales conversion"},{"text":"Profitability"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build a SQL + Power BI business dashboard."},{"type":"h","text":"2. Customer Churn Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Customer","Usage","Complaints","Churn"]},{"type":"p","text":"Produce:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Churn dashboard"},{"text":"Customer segments"},{"text":"Root-cause analysis"},{"text":"Business recommendations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Business Process Improvement"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose a process such as:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Customer complaint","ticket creation","assignment","resolution"]},{"type":"p","text":"Map:"},{"type":"flow","items":["As-Is","Problems","To-Be","Expected benefits"]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Requirements Analysis Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Design a fictional business system such as:"},{"type":"h","text":"Online Retail Order Management System"},{"type":"p","text":"Prepare:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"BRD"},{"text":"Stakeholder map"},{"text":"User stories"},{"text":"Use cases"},{"text":"Process flow"},{"text":"Data requirements"},{"text":"Acceptance criteria"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Digital Transformation Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse a traditional business process and propose:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Manual Process","Digital Workflow","Analytics","Automation"]}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The internship should ideally provide exposure to real business problems, not only administrative work."},{"type":"h","text":"Strong Internship Roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Business Analytics Intern"},{"text":"Data Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Product Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Business Operations Intern"},{"text":"Strategy Intern"},{"text":"Consulting Intern"},{"text":"Process Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Operations Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Product Management Intern"},{"text":"Technology Consulting Intern"},{"text":"Digital Transformation Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Internship Work"},{"type":"p","text":"Look for projects involving:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Requirement gathering"},{"text":"Business reporting"},{"text":"SQL analysis"},{"text":"Dashboard development"},{"text":"Process mapping"},{"text":"Customer analysis"},{"text":"Market analysis"},{"text":"Product analytics"},{"text":"Operational improvement"},{"text":"Stakeholder interaction"}]}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After completing the IPM, possible roles include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business Analyst"},{"text":"Junior Business Analyst"},{"text":"Business Systems Analyst"},{"text":"Business Analytics Analyst"},{"text":"Business Operations Analyst"},{"text":"Process Analyst"},{"text":"Data Analyst"},{"text":"Product Analyst"},{"text":"Functional Analyst"},{"text":"Reporting Analyst"},{"text":"Strategy Analyst"},{"text":"Operations Analyst"},{"text":"Technology Business Analyst"},{"text":"Digital Transformation Analyst"},{"text":"Associate Consultant"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business Analyst Specialisations"},{"type":"h","text":"1. IT / Technology Business Analyst"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Software requirements"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"Databases"},{"text":"SDLC"},{"text":"Agile"},{"text":"System integrations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the strongest routes for candidates who enjoy technology."},{"type":"h","text":"2. Data/Analytics Business Analyst"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Data modelling"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Business intelligence"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Business Systems Analyst"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Enterprise applications"},{"text":"ERP"},{"text":"CRM"},{"text":"System requirements"},{"text":"Integrations"},{"text":"Business processes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Product Analyst"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User behaviour"},{"text":"Product metrics"},{"text":"Funnels"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"A/B testing"},{"text":"Product experimentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Strategy/Consulting Analyst"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Market research"},{"text":"Competitive analysis"},{"text":"Financial analysis"},{"text":"Business strategy"},{"text":"Problem structuring"},{"text":"Executive presentations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. Operations Business Analyst"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Process improvement"},{"text":"Operational KPIs"},{"text":"Workforce"},{"text":"Supply chain"},{"text":"Cost optimisation"},{"text":"Automation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Employer Skill Matrix"},{"type":"table","header":["Employer","High-Value Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"IT services"},{"text":"Requirements + SQL + Agile + SDLC"}],[{"text":"SaaS companies"},{"text":"Product + SQL + analytics"}],[{"text":"Consulting firms"},{"text":"Problem solving + Excel + PowerPoint + analytics"}],[{"text":"Banks"},{"text":"Finance + SQL + risk + requirements"}],[{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"Product analytics + SQL + customer analytics"}],[{"text":"Healthcare"},{"text":"Process analysis + compliance + analytics"}],[{"text":"Manufacturing"},{"text":"Operations + process improvement + ERP"}],[{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"Finance + technology + analytics"}],[{"text":"Retail"},{"text":"Customer + sales + category analytics"}],[{"text":"Startups"},{"text":"Product + analytics + execution"}]]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Certifications are useful, but projects and practical experience are more important."},{"type":"h","text":"High-Priority Skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Business Analysis"},{"text":"Agile/Scrum"},{"text":"Jira"},{"text":"Process Modelling"},{"text":"Data Analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Useful Certifications"},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on career direction:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ECBA / business analysis fundamentals"},{"text":"PMI-PBA later in career"},{"text":"CBAP later after sufficient experience"},{"text":"Microsoft Power BI-oriented certification"},{"text":"SQL/data analytics certifications"},{"text":"Scrum/Agile certification"},{"text":"Lean Six Sigma"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Do not collect many certificates without demonstrating the corresponding skills through projects."}]},{"heading":"PG Study","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Because IPM already contains an MBA component, another general MBA immediately after graduation is usually unnecessary."},{"type":"p","text":"Instead, later specialisation can come through:"},{"type":"h","text":"Relevant Specialised Master's"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MSc Business Analytics"},{"text":"MSc Data Analytics"},{"text":"MSc Information Systems"},{"text":"MSc Management Information Systems"},{"text":"MSc Operations Research"},{"text":"MSc Digital Transformation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional Development"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business Analysis"},{"text":"Product Management"},{"text":"Data Analytics"},{"text":"Strategy"},{"text":"Consulting"},{"text":"Project Management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"An additional degree should ideally fill a specific skill or domain gap rather than simply repeat general management education."},{"type":"h","text":"Consulting & Strategy Route"},{"type":"p","text":"The IPM structure can also support a transition toward consulting."},{"type":"p","text":"Potential progression:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Analyst","Senior Business Analyst","Consultant","Senior Consultant","Manager","Principal/Director"]},{"type":"p","text":"Skills required:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Structured problem solving"},{"text":"Market research"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"Financial analysis"},{"text":"Business cases"},{"text":"Data analysis"},{"text":"Client communication"},{"text":"Executive storytelling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Government / Public-Sector Route"},{"type":"p","text":"Business-analysis skills can also be useful in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Public-sector consulting"},{"text":"Digital government projects"},{"text":"Government technology programmes"},{"text":"Public-sector banks"},{"text":"Policy and programme implementation"},{"text":"Public-sector analytics"},{"text":"E-governance projects"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Eligibility depends on the specific organisation and recruitment notification."},{"type":"h","text":"AI & Future of Business Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"AI will increasingly automate parts of traditional Business Analyst work, particularly:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Basic data analysis"},{"text":"Report generation"},{"text":"Meeting transcription"},{"text":"Requirement summarisation"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Dashboard generation"},{"text":"SQL generation"},{"text":"Process documentation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"However, higher-value BA work remains strongly dependent on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Problem definition"},{"text":"Stakeholder management"},{"text":"Business judgement"},{"text":"Requirement validation"},{"text":"Prioritisation"},{"text":"Process redesign"},{"text":"Decision-making"},{"text":"Change management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Therefore, the future BA should become an AI-augmented business problem solver, rather than only a documentation specialist."},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging Capabilities"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-assisted requirements engineering"},{"text":"Generative AI for business analysis"},{"text":"Process mining"},{"text":"Intelligent automation"},{"text":"Predictive analytics"},{"text":"Decision intelligence"},{"text":"AI product analytics"},{"text":"Data governance"},{"text":"Responsible AI"},{"text":"Digital twins"},{"text":"Agentic workflow automation"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Core BA Route"},{"type":"flow","items":["IPM","Business Analyst Intern","Business Analyst","Senior Business Analyst","Lead Business Analyst","Business Analysis Manager","Head of Business Analysis / Transformation"]},{"type":"h","text":"Product Route"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Analyst","Product Analyst","Associate Product Manager","Product Manager","Senior Product Manager","Product Director"]},{"type":"h","text":"Consulting Route"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Analyst","Consultant","Senior Consultant","Manager","Principal / Director"]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business strategy"},{"text":"Operations"},{"text":"Finance"},{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Economics"},{"text":"Industry knowledge"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business Analysis"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Requirements gathering"},{"text":"Stakeholder analysis"},{"text":"BRD/FRD"},{"text":"User stories"},{"text":"Use cases"},{"text":"Process modelling"},{"text":"Gap analysis"},{"text":"Root-cause analysis"},{"text":"Business case development"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Data visualisation"},{"text":"Data modelling"},{"text":"Forecasting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SDLC"},{"text":"Agile/Scrum"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"Databases"},{"text":"Cloud fundamentals"},{"text":"ERP/CRM concepts"},{"text":"Jira/Confluence"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Presentation"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Facilitation"},{"text":"Problem solving"},{"text":"Critical thinking"},{"text":"Stakeholder management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Prompt engineering"},{"text":"AI-assisted analytics"},{"text":"Generative AI"},{"text":"AI workflow automation"},{"text":"AI product analytics"},{"text":"Responsible AI concepts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Progression"},{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Target Position","Core Evidence"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Business foundation"},{"text":"Management + statistics + Excel"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Analytics foundation"},{"text":"SQL + Power BI + process analysis"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Junior BA-ready"},{"text":"Requirements + Agile + documentation"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Advanced BA preparation"},{"text":"Analytics + technology + industry specialisation"}],[{"text":"Year 5"},{"text":"Professional readiness"},{"text":"MBA strategy + internship + capstone"}],[{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Business Analyst"},{"text":"Requirements + SQL + BI + stakeholder management"}],[{"text":"2–5 years"},{"text":"Senior Business Analyst"},{"text":"Complex projects + process ownership"}],[{"text":"5–8 years"},{"text":"Lead BA / Consultant"},{"text":"Strategic analysis + leadership"}],[{"text":"8–12 years"},{"text":"BA Manager / Product Manager"},{"text":"Portfolio and team leadership"}],[{"text":"12+ years"},{"text":"Transformation / Strategy Leadership"},{"text":"Enterprise-level decision making"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"For IPM (BBA+MBA) → Business Analyst, the strongest profile is not simply a management graduate with Excel knowledge. The student should graduate as a business-and-technology bridge who can understand a business problem, analyse evidence, document requirements, model processes, communicate with stakeholders, and work effectively with technology teams."},{"type":"p","text":"The ideal profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["IPM","Advanced Excel","SQL","Power BI","Business Analysis","Requirements Engineering","Process Modelling","Agile","Business Communication","Technology Fundamentals","Industry Knowledge","AI-assisted Analytics."],"sep":"+"}]}]}